1 NOTE {geni:about_me} R' Phineas Samuel Katzenellenbogen A.B.D. Hegenheim from 1821 and died aged thirty one in 1828, shortly after his father.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Riesele, the daughter of Samuel Wahl (died 1862), himself the son of Salomon (Zalman) Wahl of Hegenheim.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reisele emarried Moses Levy of Blotzheim*.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their grand-daughter from the first marriage was the wife of Leopold Dreyfus f Basel, Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Source=
2 CONT
2 CONT The Unbroken Chain - Neil Rosenstein (1990) Volume 1, chapter 11, page 102, G 10.1
2 CONT
2 CONT *  Dr. Achilles Nordmann, Der Israelitische Friedhof in Hegenheim (1910) p 28, p 116 and 138.  Page 115 records that this Wahl family claimed descent from Saul Wahl.
