1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dr Siegfried Merzbacher  studied at the Wilhelms-Gymnasium. He then studied chemistry under Wilstaetter and got a job with the Auer Society in Oranienburg (near Berlin). He married Lilli and emigrated to Turkey—he 
2 CONC got a job with the Turkish Gas Mask Company in Ankara. Eugen is a professor of physics at Duke University in Chapel Hill, North Carolina. His daughter Dorothea is married to a teacher in England.
