1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Luise married Willy Feistmann, a son of Joseph Feistmann and his wife (a nee Berlin). He later joined Luise's uncle Georg Jaffé’s timber business in Berlin, but died of a heart attack at a relatively young age. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The oldest son Rudy, was a distinguished writer and member of the German Communist Party journalist from 1933, when he emigrated to Paris, then to Mexico, returning to East Germany in 1947, where he became foreign editor of the of
2 CONC ficial party daily, Neues Deutschland. Rudy took his own life (officially he was said to have died of food poisoning) in June 1950 at a time of deep schisms in the party. He left a letter expressing his total political disillusion
2 CONC .
2 CONT
