2 CONT David Edmond Neuberger, Baron Neuberger of Abbotsbury, Kt, PC /ˈnjuːbɜrɡər/ (born 10 January 1948), is an English judge. He is currently President of the Supreme Court of the United Kingdom. He was a Lord of Appeal in Ordinary unt
2 CONC il the House of Lords' judicial functions were transferred to the new Supreme Court in 2009, at which point he became Master of the Rolls, the second most senior judge in England and Wales. He also serves as a Non-Permanent Judge 
2 CONC of the Hong Kong Court of Final Appeal.
