1 NAME Gabriel /Didisheim/
2 GIVN Gabriel
2 SURN Didisheim
2 _MARNM Didisheim
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 22 JUL 1825
2 PLAC Alsace
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hégenheim
