1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: There seems to be an error in Chapter 11, page 262 of "The Unbroken Chain", where it says she had a 2nd marriage to Solomon Brodsky, son of Abraham Brodsky, and that Solomon was her first cousin.  Actually, A
2 CONC braham Brodsky doesn't appear to have had any son named Solomon, and in "The Unbroken Chain", there is no Solomon listed as a son of Abraham Brodsky (see G12.3 Abraham Brodsky, in Chapter 11, page 263).  However, the book does ind
2 CONC icate that G12.3 Abraham Brodsky had a daughter named Marie, who married a Solomon Brodsky, who according to some sources (i.e. AZBrodsky tree on Ancestry) was a son of G12.3 Abraham Brodsky's brother Israel Brodsky, and therefore
2 CONC  would have been a 1st cousin to his wife Marie Brodsky, daughter of Abraham Brodsky.
