1 NAME Shmuel Heilperin /Helman/ ABD Metz
2 GIVN Shmuel Heilperin
2 SURN Helman
2 NSFX ABD Metz
2 _MARNM Helman
2 NICK Samuel
2 NICK Hillman
2 NICK ABD Mannheim & Metz
1 SEX M
1 OCCU unknown
2 PLAC Grand Rabbi of Metz
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1672
2 ADDR
3 CITY Krotoszyn
3 STAE Greater Poland Voivodeship
3 CTRY Poland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 30 DEC 1764
2 ADDR
3 CITY Metz
3 STAE Grand Est
3 CTRY France
1 OCCU Grand Rabbi of Metz, אב בית דין קהילה מיץ, ABD Mannheim & Metz
1 TITL Rabbi
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ira Albert:
2 CONT
2 CONT  Rabbi Shmuel (Heilprin) Hillman, chief rabbi of Metz, France (born 1670 in Krotoszyn in Poland) He was also the chief rabbi of Mannheim.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT In picture: See the last line. Shmuel Hillman signs his name as son of Israel Heilprin of Krotoszyn in the Pinkas Vaad Arba Aratzot, Jerusalem, Bialik Institute, 1945 p. 230
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Among numerous accomplishments, he provided the Jewish community of Metz with the first Hebrew printing shop in France, thus helping establish some independence from Germany and Poland in the field of printing.
2 CONT
2 CONT Not sure of place of death. One source says that in later years, he returned to Germany where he became chief rabbi of Hamburg-Altona, until his death in 1764.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Chief Rabbi of Metz
2 CONT
2 CONT *************************************************************
2 CONT
2 CONT Please see Gelles Halpern Tree: http://archives.balliol.ox.ac.uk/Modern%20Papers/gelles/2017Metz.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT see also this duplicate https://www.geni.com/people/Shmuel-Halpern-Heilprin-Helman-Brisk/6000000219136625518; appears to be some confusion in the source as to who is the father of Shmuel Heilprin Hilman Helman: Ysroel or Shraga (0
2 CONC 9 Jan 2026)
