2 CONT Julia Babette Sarah Neuberger, Baroness Neuberger, DBE (née Schwab; born 27 February 1950) is a member of the British House of Lords. She formerly took the Liberal Democrat whip, but resigned from the party and joined the Crossben
2 CONC ches in September 2011 upon becoming the full-time senior rabbi to the West London Synagogue.
